      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A nation wide Civil Defense test \"OPERATION ALERT 1956\", will be held for an entire week beginning Friday, July 20th, 1956. New York City's participation is such that municipal employees who are enrolled in Civil Defense are needed from 12:55 P.M. Friday, July 20th, 1956 until 11:00 P.M., July 21st, 1956.",
